      "writtenOn": "2026-04-29T17:24:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To avoid confusion between `hyp_page_count()` and `hyp_pagetable_count()`, I wonder if we could rework things slightly here? Specifically, I\u0027m thinking:\n\n1. Have `hyp_page_count()` do the `- 1` adjustment\n2. Introduce `static bool hyp_page_referenced()`, private to `mem_protect.c` which just tells you whether the underlying (unadjusted) refcount is non-zero.\n\nWDYT?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 134,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 134,
        "endChar": 37
      },
      "revId": "e4c3bc74cc4af1da0d5b940d1087b59f113b9498",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
